# Patch for CVE-2026-41650
# Fix XML comment and CDATA injection via unescaped delimiters in XMLBuilder
#
# XMLBuilder does not escape the "-->" sequence in comment content or the "]]>"
# sequence in CDATA sections when building XML from JavaScript objects. This
# allows XML injection when user-controlled data flows into comments or CDATA
# elements, leading to XSS, SOAP injection, or data manipulation.
#
# Fix: Escape "--" in comment content and "]]>" in CDATA content before
# embedding values in generated XML.
#
# Severity: medium
# Affected versions: prior to 5.7.0
# Fixed in: 5.7.0
# Advisory: https://github.com/NaturalIntelligence/fast-xml-parser/security/advisories/GHSA-gh4j-gqv2-49f6

